WEBVTT
Kind: subtitles
Language: en

00:00:00.221 --> 00:00:04.411
The concept of secrets for children

00:00:10.965 --> 00:00:16.424
The abuser uses secrecy to ensure
that the child remains silent.

00:00:16.783 --> 00:00:20.727
It is therefore important to teach children
the difference between good and bad secrets.

00:00:21.144 --> 00:00:23.090
A good secret

00:00:23.267 --> 00:00:25.910
is a secret that puts no one
in danger or causes anyone harm.

00:00:26.463 --> 00:00:29.727
It is often linked to a pleasant surprise
or a happy moment.

00:00:31.024 --> 00:00:33.095
A bad secret

00:00:33.095 --> 00:00:34.516
is a secret that makes someone unhappy,

00:00:34.516 --> 00:00:39.689
or makes a child feel afraid, worried,
guilty or ashamed.

00:00:40.741 --> 00:00:43.268
It is a secret that can
put the child in danger.
